nes full-page routes/pages\n\n### Router entry\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/hooks/useCreateWorkspaceAppRouter.tsx`\n- `:117` `return createBrowserRouter([ ... ])`\n- `:127-141` authenticated shell nesting: `MinimalMetadataGate` → `DefaultLayout` → `MainAppLayoutWithSidePanel` → `getWorkspaceRouteObjectsForSurface(workspaceRouteObjects, 'main')`\n- `:144-269` unauthenticated/onboarding routes under `AuthFlowLayout` / `BlankLayout`.\n\nRoot (no-auth) router is separate: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/hooks/useCreateRootAppRouter.tsx:37-87` (used for `/share/:shareToken`, auth). Workspace pages go in the **workspace** router.\n\nA second renderer for nested/panel routes: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/routing/components/WorkspaceRoutes.tsx:16-25` (`useRoutes(surfaceRouteObjects, location)`).\n\n### The route registry (this is where you add the chat page)\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/routing/utils/createWorkspaceRouteObjects.tsx`\n- Lazy page imports `:14-54` (pattern: `lazy(() => import('~/pages/...').then(m => ({ default: m.XxxPage })))`).\n- Route array `:72-155`. Representative entry (AI chat), `:122-129`:\n```tsx\n{\n  path: AppPath.AiChat,\n  element: (\n    <LazyRoute>\n      <AiChatPage />\n    </LazyRoute>\n  ),\n},\n```\n- Route entries may carry a `handle` (`WorkspaceRouteObject.ts:5-10`) controlling surfaces:\n```ts\nexport type WorkspaceRouteHandle = {\n  workspaceSurfaces: readonly WorkspaceSurfaceType[];   // 'main' | 'side-panel'\n  isLocationExpandableFromSidePanel?: boolean | ((args) => boolean);\n};\n```\n- `:89-104` example with `handle: { workspaceSurfaces: MAIN_AND_SIDE_PANEL, isLocationExpandableFromSidePanel: true }`.\n\n`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/routing/utils/getWorkspaceRouteObjectsForSurface.tsx:12-20`: routes default to 