atTypingIndicator.ts` (hand-written `gql`).\n   - `hooks/` wrapping object-record hooks for channels/messages/reactions/read-cursors + hand-written queries.\n   - `components/` (sidebar, thread pane, composer, message list) styled with Linaria + `themeCssVariables`, strings via Lingui, icons from `twenty-ui/icon`.\n3. **Page**: `src/pages/chat/ChatPage.tsx` (thin), named export.\n4. **Route**: register in `createWorkspaceRouteObjects.tsx` with `LazyRoute`; add `handle` only if the page should open in the side panel (for the later mini-chat task).\n5. **Nav**: the existing a2e-chat `Discussions` nav row (VIEW → `chatChannels`) can remain, or point a new nav entry at the page. Remember: app nav rows are DB data; do not hard-code a nav item, and do not expect the app to add a route.\n6. **Tests**: `__tests__` siblings for sidebar grouping, thread expansion, read-state transitions (pure reducers/utils + component tests).\n7. **Follow-on**: `P5.2-chat-live` (realtime via `useRealtimeTopic`/offline queue/presence) and `P5.2-record-linked-channels` both depend on this page.\n\n### Caveats / gaps found\n- **Route collision** with `AppPath.AiChat = '/chat/:threadId?'`.\n- **No generated GraphQL** for a2e-chat's `chatMessages`/`chatUnreadCounts`/`sendChatTypingIndicator`; use hand-written `gql` (pattern `a2e-workspace`) or add a `./src/modules/chat/graphql/**` glob to `codegen-metadata.cjs` and regenerate.\n- **No emoji-picker primitive** exists in `twenty-ui` or twenty-front (only BlockNote's built-in emoji via `IconMoodSmile` in slash menus: `modules/blocknote-editor/utils/getSlashMenu.ts:55`). The \"emoji picker from twenty-ui set\" acceptance likely needs a curated emoji list rendered with twenty-ui components; flag if a real picker is expected.\n- **`@mention` autocomplete** already exists: `modules/mention/` (`MentionSuggestionMenu.tsx`, `useMentionSearch.ts` using the core `SEARCH_QUERY`). Reuse it; do not build a second mention system.\n- **Apps cannot add routes** (`