on.tsx:2,23,45-47` (`title={t\\`A2E Suite\\`}`).\n  - Interpolation: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/realtime/components/RealtimeTypingIndicator.tsx:70-79` (`` t`${getDisplayName(...)} is typing…` ``).\n- Non-component strings: `import { t } from '@lingui/core/macro';` — `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/components/A2eSuiteApplicationCard.tsx:8,66-67,96,101`.\n- JSX with markup: `import { Trans } from '@lingui/react/macro';` — e.g. `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-show/components/RecordIdentifierBarCreatedAt.tsx:6`.\n- Tests load catalogs explicitly (see §9). ⚠️ Do **not** commit `locales/**` or `generated/**` catalog churn (AGENTS.md).\n- Acceptance requires fr + en.\n\n---\n\n## 7. twenty-ui icon usage\n\n- Rule: import from `twenty-ui/icon` only; never `@tabler/icons-react` (`icon-dictionary.md:12`).\n```tsx\nimport { IconMessage } from 'twenty-ui/icon';\n```\n- Canonical dictionary: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/src/icon/icon-dictionary.md`. Entries relevant to chat:\n  - `:94` **Conversation / Chat → `IconMessage` (`message`)** — \"AI conversation or chat thread\".\n  - `:117` **Attachments → `IconPaperclip`**.\n  - `:116` Files → `IconFiles`.\n  - Selection rule `:10`: use action icons (`IconPlus`, `IconEdit`…) for actions.\n- Additional exported icons (verified in `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/src/icon/index.ts`): `IconMessage` (`:345`), `IconMessageCirclePlus` (`:346`), `IconMoodSmile` (`:350`), `IconPaperclip` (`:362`), `IconSend` (`:412`), plus `IconPlus` (`:381`).\n  - ⚠️ `IconMessages` (plural) and `IconHash` are **not exported** by `twenty-ui/icon` (the a2e-chat metadata uses the *string* `'IconMessages'`, resolved server-side — that is a different namespace). For the native page use `IconMessage`/`IconMessageCirclePlus`.\n- Action usage example: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/ai/components/internal/AgentChatFileUploadButton.tsx:7,55` (`import { IconPaperclip } from 'twenty-ui/icon'` → `<Button Icon={IconPaperclip} … />`).\n- Dynamic metadata icons: `const { getIcon } = useIcons();` (`EventIconDynamicComponent.tsx:4,14,21`).\n\n---\n\n## 8. GraphQL codegen pattern in twenty-front\n\n### Where generated types live\n- Metadata schema → `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/generated-metadata/graphql.ts` (1.3 MB). Import as `import { XxxDocument, type XxxQuery } from '~/generated-metadata/graphql';`\n- Core schema → `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/generated/graphql.ts`.\n- Admin schema → `src/generated-admin/graphql.ts`.\n- Aliases in `packages/twenty-front/tsconfig.json:23-26`: `@/* → src/modules/*`, `~/* → src/*`.\n\n### Codegen configs scope which documents are generated\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/codegen-metadata.cjs:7-53` enumerates explicit globs (`./src/modules/ai/graphql/**`, `front-components/graphql/**`, `./src/pages/**/graphql/**`, …). **There is no `modules/chat` glob.**\n- Command: `npx nx run twenty-front:graphql:generate` (AGENTS.md).\n- ⚠️ The generated `chatMessages` field belongs to the **AI agent** (`AgentMessage`), not a2e chat: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/generated-metadata/graphql.ts:4835,7467`. So the a2e-chat server resolver's `chatMessages`/`chatUnreadCounts`/`sendChatTypingIndicator` are **not** in generated types.\n\n### Two consumption patterns\n**(a) Hand-written `gql` + typed `useQuery`** (the established pattern when codegen doesn't cover it — exactly your case). `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/graphql/queries/workspaceTemplatePreview.ts:1-31`:\n```ts\nimport { gql } from '@apollo/client';\n// Hand-written document ... regenerate with npx nx run twenty-front:graphql:generate\n// against an updated server, then switch to the generated *Document.\nexport const WORKSPACE_TEMPLATE_PREVIEW = gql`\n  query WorkspaceTemplatePreview($template: WorkspaceTemplate!) { ... }\n`;\n```\nConsumed in `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/hooks/useWorkspaceTemplatePreview.ts:1-35`:\n```ts\nconst { data, loading, error } = useQuery<Data, Vars>(WORKSPACE_TEMPLATE_PREVIEW, { variables: {...}, skip });\n```\n(Mutations same pattern: `graphql/mutations/applyWorkspaceTemplate.ts:1-13`.)\n\n**(b) Generated `*Document`** — `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/front-components/components/FrontComponentRenderer.tsx:19-23,54-56`:\n```ts\nimport { FindOneFrontComponentDocument, type FindOneFrontComponentQuery } from '~/generated-metadata/graphql';\nconst { data, loading, error } = useQuery(FindOneFrontComponentDocument, { variables: { id } });\n```\nQuery source files use either `import gql from 'graphql-tag'` (`findOneFrontComponent.ts:1`) or `import { gql } from '@apollo/client'` (`workspaceTemplatePreview.ts:1`); both appear in-tree. Generated hooks use `useQuery`/`useMutation` from `@apollo/client/react`; imperative calls use `useApolloCoreClient()` (`modules/object-metadata/hooks/useApolloCoreClient`).\n\n### Preferred path for app-owned objects (chatChannel/chatMessage/…)\nNative-law §4 (`04-twenty-native-law.md:129-131`): \"Consume metadata objects through the standard object-record machinery … do not hand-roll record fetching for metadata objects.\" Use the generic, metadata-driven hooks keyed by `objectNameSingular`:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/hooks/useFindManyRecords.ts:36-147` (filter/orderBy/limit/cursor pagination, reads `objectMetadataItem` at runtime).\n- `useCreateOneRecord.ts:42-225`, `useUpdateOneRecord.ts`, `useFindOneRecord.ts`, `useDeleteOneRecord.ts` (same folder).\n\nSuggested split:\n- `chatChannel`/`chatChannelMember`/`chatMessage`/`chatReaction`/`chatReadCursor` CRUD → object-record hooks (object names from a2e-chat: `chatChannel`/`chatChannels`, `chatMessage`/`chatMessages`, etc.).\n- The keyset `chatMessages(channelId, limit, after)` connection, `chatUnreadCounts`, and `sendChatTypingIndicator` mutation → hand-written `gql` documents in `src/modules/chat/graphql/{queries,mutations}/`, typed locally, per pattern (a).\n\nServer surface (for shaping the documents): `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/modules/chat/resolvers/chat.resolver.ts:44-92` (`chatMessages(channelId, limit, after)`, `chatUnreadCounts`, `sendChatTypingIndicator(input)`). Object field shapes: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-chat/src/objects/chat-message.object.ts:18-126` (body, editedAt, channel, author, threadParent/threadReplies, reactions, readCursors) and `chat-channel.object.ts:19-110` (name, kind, visibility, topic, postingRoles, messages, members, readCursors).\n\nRealtime (for the follow-on `P5.2-chat-live`, useful context): `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/realtime/hooks/useRealtimeTopic.ts:14-66`; offline queue `useRealtimeOfflineQueue.ts:12`; presence `useWorkspacePresence.ts:24`; UI primitives `RealtimeTypingIndicator.tsx`, `RealtimePresenceAvatarStack.tsx`.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Jest config + test conventions for twenty-front\n\nConfig: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/jest.config.mjs`\n- `:24-27` preset `../../jest.preset.js`, `setupFilesAfterEach './setupTests.ts'`, `testEnvironment: 'jsdom'`.\n- `:34-54` `@swc/jest` with `@lingui/swc-plugin`.\n- `:55-63` `moduleNameMapper` from tsconfig paths (`@/*`, `~/*`).\n- `:73-91` coverage ignores `states/*State.ts`, `graphql/queries|mutations`, `types/*`, `constants/*`, `generated*`.\n- Run a single spec (prd quality gate): `npx jest <spec> --config=packages/twenty-front/jest.config.mjs`.\n\nRepresentative specs:\n1. **Component +